<title>USA: Dow drops more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell more than 50 points in early trading Friday, hurt by weakness in the bond market.</p>
<p>The 30-share Dow was off 60.16 points at 7,881.87 minutes after the opening, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
